# Code window

Code Window displays multi-line code with copying, line numbers, and optional file details. The examples show highlighted and changed lines, language switching, and scrolling. Use [Snippet](/docs/components/snippet) for a single command.

Syntax colors in the first example come from Shiki at docs build time; Code Window itself stays lightweight and accepts highlighted content through `renderLine`.

